lines+=['', 'Read-only source snapshots: `bun run docs/evidence/audit-remediation-20260927/r01-forward/task-6-fix-1-source-states.ts before-gates` and `after-gates`, exits0. Template '+before['template']+' remains '+after['template']+'. Dedicated modern full-suite fixture transition: preformat '+prebefore['modern']+' → '+preafter['modern']+'; final '+before['modern']+' → '+after['modern']+'. These are actual before/after aggregates, separate from strict per-clone/source preservation; no normalization/reset.', '', '## Bindings, preservation and remaining gates','', '`task-6-fix-1-source-binding.json` schema r01-task6-fix1-binding-v1 binds exact final SQL/runner/generator/manifest/current HTTP/DB test observed24 and final gate30, five-file DB runtime closure, new raw artifacts and nine-path candidate source tree. Original7f DB22/final29/raw71 binding and true receipts/logs stay immutable. The sole changed current path in original raw71 is the authoritative generator: base-7f-generator.ts preserves its exact original raw bytes; canonical Git FIX_BASE version is bound separately. SQL/runner/manifest exact original observed bytes are also archived and bound. Do not claim all71 original current paths equal. Old observed HTTP mismatch remains only in the original7f binding; final Fix1 maps have no differing observed inputs. Separate versions preserve every failure and preformat composition.', '', 'Accepted dependency remains Task5 exact592/draftPR189/CI36928397189 attempt1 allfiveSUCCESS (verify,a11y-verify,brand-verify,rls-matrix,performance-verify); no production/release authority. Task1 ACL/actor human gate, full-branch R01 readiness, production/deployment/enablement, hosted Auth internals, live JWT/PostgREST/browser/provider/full checkout/recovery and exact new-head CI are not run or pending. No other product/security policy or M1 cleanup. Controller owns same-reviewer scoped7f..FIXHEAD review and draft publication/CI after acceptance.','']
